==Battleground==
*3 [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>, delay 33.33~66.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~2,000f</sup>.
*2 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 18.33~20 seconds<sup>550f~600f</sup>.
*2 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 28.33 seconds<sup>850f</sup>, delay 18.33~20 seconds<sup>550f~600f</sup>.
*2 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 18.33~20 seconds<sup>550f~600f</sup>.
*5 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 0.67~1.67 seconds<sup>20f~50f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Heavenly Hippoe]] spawns as the boss.
**7 [[Angelic Gory|Angelic Gories]] spawn, delay 8.33~16.67 seconds<sup>250f~500f</sup>.
**1 [[Angelic Gory]] spawns.
**8 [[Gabriel]]s spawn, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Gabriel]]s spawn, delay 16.67~33.33 seconds<sup>500f~1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The start is relatively easy, but once you hit the base, Angelic Gories start spawning. Long ranged and [[:Category:Anti-Angel Cats|anti-Angel Cats]] are recommended for dealing with them, [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Artist Cat]] being a prime example.

